  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Tutorial-Shadow-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And it begins with a pact. You must let the Shadow in, as I have. Within the darkness are creatures, forbidden from the Spiral, scratching to get in.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sofia_DarkSide_Shadow_KR-MOON_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Tutorial-Shadow-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So let them in, let them attach themselves to you, experience through you, and they will enhance your own power.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sofia_DarkSide_Shadow_KR-MOON_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Tutorial-Shadow-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This pact need not be feared, the creatures are not malevolent, the Shadow is not evil, but its loyalties are to itself, banished as it was from our realm.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sofia_DarkSide_Shadow_KR-MOON_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Tutorial-Shadow-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Thus Shadow Creatures demand a tribute when summoned that the native beasts of the Spiral do not. Our magic for theirs. Light for darkness.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sofia_DarkSide_Shadow_KR-MOON_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Tutorial-Shadow-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Here, I will show you.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sofia_DarkSide_Shadow_KR-MOON_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700183,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Tutorial-Shadow-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This will lead you to a shadow of this tower. There you can meet these creatures and learn their ways.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_DM|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Sofia_DarkSide_Shadow_KR-MOON_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
